WEBVTT

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:16.060
It's not a Japanese summer without
strawberry milk shaved ice.

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:19.390
Is it good, Alice?

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:20.280
Yeah.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.450
I'm glad you like it.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.300
Eat as much as you want.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.820
Thanks, Shino.

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:32.920
Go on, have some more.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.960
We have tons more ice.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:37.910
Shino, my head...

00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:40.410
My head hurts...

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:44.600
<i>Is this some new kind of torture?</i>

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:20.480
A Long Night

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:25.720
It's from Karen-chan!

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:31.600
"After practice tomorrow,

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.020
I'll bring you a souvenir from the beach."

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:34.370
Sub: Souvenir!

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:34.370
From: Karen-chan

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:34.370
After practice tomorrow, I'll bring you a souvenir from the beach.

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:40.190
A souvenir from Karen-chan?

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:41.500
I wonder what it is.

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:43.560
I know!

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:46.060
Golden!

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:47.380
Hair!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.370
Wow.

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.950
Matsubara-senpai's been playing well

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:55.900
since the practice match.

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.060
But why does she keep saying "hair"?

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:00.260
Gather 'round!

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:04.650
Hey...

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:08.250
Do you really have to shout
"golden" and "hair" like that?

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:11.660
Shouting those words when
I shoot makes me play better.

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:17.330
Thanks for waiting.

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.910
What's up? Are you looking for someone?

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:20.670
Yeah.

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:23.740
<i>Maybe she's not coming today...</i>

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.090
It's Karen-chan.

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:29.430
Hello?

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.340
I am Karen-san.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.430
I am in the school.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.430
Karen-chan?

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:41.970
What's Karen-chan doing in here?

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:43.120
Who knows?

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.800
I am Karen-san.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:48.190
Look behind you.

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:50.570
Look Up

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:51.570
To the Side

00:03:51.570 --> 00:03:52.320
This Way

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:56.080
What is this?

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:58.280
Is she playing cat and mouse with me?

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:06.400
Alice told me that Japanese people
like to get gifts as surprises.

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:08.670
I'm going to surprise Honoka.

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:09.790
Kujou-san.

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:10.800
Surprise!

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:12.960
Did you put these up?

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:14.720
I-I'll go take them down!

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.600
And you're not in uniform.

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:19.140
What are you doing at
school during vacation?

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:21.440
There's something I wanted to know.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:22.810
What is it?

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.820
Where do we come from?

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:28.320
What are we? Where are we going?

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:29.140
What?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:31.570
I want to know.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.650
G-Give me a minute.

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:37.990
Uh, "where do we come from?"

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:39.380
Where...

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.290
There she is. Karen-chan!

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.290
...do we come from...

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:44.220
Honoka! Kana!

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.300
Hello, Kuzehashi-sensei.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:48.950
O-Oh, yes. Hello.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:51.460
I'm going to go now.

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:53.420
When you find the answer, let me know.

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:57.100
Oh, and these are for you and Karasuma-sensei.

00:04:57.410 --> 00:04:59.040
Th-Thank you...

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:04.850
These are the kind that glow in the dark.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.720
I'll have to thank her next time I see her.

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:09.980
Where did she get these?

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.610
Wh-Who knows?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.620
"Where do we come from?"

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.870
"What are we?"

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:19.600
What was that about Gauguin's painting?

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:20.260
Huh?

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:23.840
For you... And for you!

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:30.500
I
♥
The
Blazing
Sun

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:28.290
I can really have one, too?

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:29.510
Of course.

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:30.500
Thank you.

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:33.260
I am most grateful.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.880
Think nothing of it.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:40.570
I'll frame this and hang it on the wall.

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:42.770
T-shirts are meant to be worn.

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:44.880
But it'd be such a waste.

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:46.400
Honoka!

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:48.650
Let's play there before we go home.

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:51.270
Well, I should get going.

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:52.780
See you later.

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:54.150
See you.

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:58.660
Honoka!

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.380
Your clothes...

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:11.370
I'll pat them clean.

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:13.800
But won't your mother be mad?

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:18.560
Honoka, please pat me clean.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:19.050
What?

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:21.680
I could never hit you, Karen-chan!

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:25.810
Honoka, what's all this?

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:28.420
These are sweets we serve at our café.

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:31.150
I wanted to thank you for
the souvenir. Have some.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:33.060
I will!

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:37.500
Very sweet!

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:39.590
There's plenty more.

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:43.580
I'm jealous you get to eat

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.620
these tasty sweets every day.

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.680
Come by again sometime.

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:49.420
I'll treat you to even more sweets.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:51.080
Really?

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:53.630
<i>She's got something on her mouth.</i>

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:56.190
<i>I know. I'll use my handkerchief.</i>

00:06:57.320 --> 00:06:59.120
You have cream on your face.

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:01.350
Thank you.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:08.490
<i>B-But would that be overly familiar?</i>

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:10.400
<i>I should just tell her...</i>

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:13.020
Honoka? What's wrong?

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:18.470
Oh, it's nothing.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:26.890
Hey! Stop that!

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:28.740
Take this!

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:29.460
Weak.

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:31.580
Go play somewhere else!

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:33.660
You'll get the laundry wet!

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:34.740
Youko.

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:37.380
Hey, Aya. I'm kinda in the middle of...

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:38.130
Gotcha!

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:38.880
It's not over yet!

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:41.110
Youko?

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:43.530
Aya, pass!

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:46.270
I see you!

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:51.440
You don't stand a chance against—

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:53.900
You little sneaks!

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:56.010
You get three shots.

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:58.150
You have to stay alert after you shoot.

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:01.530
Good grief. Sorry, Aya... er...

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:05.530
Sorry!

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:09.160
Here.

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:10.030
Thank you.

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:13.170
Wow!

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:22.180
<i>Karen-chan's blonde hair is beautiful.</i>

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:25.960
<i>Is she a princess? An angel? A lake spirit?</i>

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:30.040
<i>And she's with me, a common girl...</i>

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:33.090
Honoka, what's wrong?

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:34.810
Nothing.

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:36.070
Oh, right...

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:40.450
Here, Karen-chan. Have some candy.

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:42.700
Oh, a candy-chan! Thank you.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.980
Come to think of it, my aunt from Kansai

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:46.820
adds "chan" to the end of candy, too.

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:47.940
I wonder why.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:51.190
Maybe she adds "chan" to everything tasty.

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:52.370
I see.

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:55.080
Like, "the strawberry
cake-chan's real yummy."

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:55.970
Ow!

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:57.000
Why?!

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:59.040
Honoka, that was bad!

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:00.840
You were supposed to make a snarky retort.

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:04.280
What? I didn't even know you were joking!

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:10.640
By the way, Karen-chan,
did you have fun at the beach?

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:14.080
Yes. We had lots of fun together.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.180
We ate yakisoba and shaved ice,

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:19.120
played beach volleyball, built sand castles...

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.360
Sounds nice.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.610
But there's one thing I forgot to do.

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:24.860
What's that?

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:27.400
I forgot to hang out with you.

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:28.490
Karen-chan...

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:31.840
Come with us next time.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:33.950
Where do you want to go?

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:36.300
The beach is nice, but so are the mountains.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:38.320
A festival could be fun, too.

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:43.660
Sometimes I wish I could've met you sooner.

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:47.660
Maybe we would've been closer friends,
like you and the other girls.

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:52.390
But you're already my best friend, Honoka.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:54.020
Karen-chan...

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:56.900
I am most grateful!

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:04.790
Oh, right.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:07.660
I'm going back to England soon.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.180
What? Y-You're going back?

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:14.660
No way. We only just became friends...

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:18.790
It's just for the last week of
summer vacation, though.

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:20.650
J-Just one week?

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:23.980
Yes. I'm going with Alice.

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:26.800
Oh, I see. That's good.

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:30.590
What souvenir would you like from England?

00:10:30.590 --> 00:10:31.790
I'll get anything you want.

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:33.230
What? Anything?

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:35.680
But no holiday homes or castles.

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:38.690
I-I wouldn't dream of it!
I don't need anything.

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:41.190
Oh, but there is one thing.

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:43.680
It's not really a souvenir,

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:46.490
but could you e-mail me every day?

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:50.450
Of course! I'd send you e-mails
even if you didn't ask me to.

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:51.710
Yay!

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:55.890
Well, I'll e-mail you, Honoka.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:57.960
Okay. I'll keep in touch, too.

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.480
Have a nice summer holiday!

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:02.640
See you later.

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:07.010
Hello!!
Kin-iro Mosaic

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:11.050
Hello!!
Kin-iro Mosaic

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:18.690
With every passing day, summer
vacation gets closer to being over.

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:20.170
Yeah.

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:21.310
Oh?

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:26.830
Is something happening on the
day you marked with a star?

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:29.970
That's the day I'm going back to England.

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:31.900
I've been talking about that, remember?

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:37.760
You should start your packing early.

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:38.510
Yeah.

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:41.210
Hmm... where's my bag?

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:42.930
Wha— Shino?!

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:45.340
Please take me with you!

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:46.710
What?

00:11:46.710 --> 00:11:49.480
I'll miss you, Alice.

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:53.970
Shino, you're making this harder for me, too.

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:56.040
I know, Shino!

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.550
Let's go together!

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:59.630
Alice... My neck...

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:00.480
My neck...

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:08.230
Alice, do you have everything?

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:08.860
Yeah.

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:11.370
I even have my kokeshi doll.

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:15.660
I wish I could become a real
kokeshi doll, just for now.

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:21.000
No, I shouldn't be this way.
You're going to see your family, and I'm...

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:22.880
Shino.

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:25.720
I'll miss you too, but it's okay.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:27.710
It's only for a week.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:32.800
If you consider all the years I didn't
see you before I came to Japan...

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:37.940
Let me get a week's worth of Shino!

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.240
Alice!

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:45.590
If you're lonely, call me anytime.

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:47.630
You can even send me a letter.

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:49.520
Oh, Shino.

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:51.900
I'd be back here before it arrived.

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:53.750
Y-You're right.

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:06.790
Shall I call Aya-chan and Youko-chan?

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:09.190
We shouldn't disturb them this early.

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:10.670
Give everyone my love, okay?

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:15.510
See you later, Shino. Bye, Shino's mum.

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:17.420
See you later.

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:18.680
Have a good time.

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:20.060
Alice...

00:13:24.140 --> 00:13:28.140
Have a safe trip!

00:13:33.940 --> 00:13:37.140
Where's Alice? Did she leave already?

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:38.200
Yes, a while ago.

00:13:38.550 --> 00:13:39.750
I see.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:43.890
I wonder if Shinobu's okay.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:49.840
A week is longer than I thought.

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:53.750
Normally, Karen would be here by now,
and we'd be playing together...

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:00.450
We've never been so far apart since
we met for the second time.

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:02.550
I'm so lonely.

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:04.170
Alice...

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:07.770
It still smells like her.

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:08.860
Alice...

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:15.860
Onee-chan...

00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:19.740
<i>I've never seen Shinobu so down before.</i>

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:21.590
<i>I'm a little worried.</i>

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:25.760
<i>She's like a kokeshi doll abandoned in the rain.</i>

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:28.860
<i>You must be strong and endure the storm.</i>

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:30.990
Alice!

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:35.630
Shinobu, that expression makes you

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:37.750
look more like a kokeshi doll than ever.

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:39.170
Cheer up.

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:42.260
Wh-What's so funny?!

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:48.390
You should go outside instead
of staying cooped up in here.

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:53.540
Shino! I don't see you here very often.

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:54.560
Aya-chan.

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:56.280
Come to think of it, isn't Alice...

00:14:58.780 --> 00:14:59.940
Alice?

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:02.220
Alice!

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:05.540
What?! The only thing we have
in common are our pigtails!

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:08.040
She left today, right?

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:10.770
Sorry I couldn't come see her off.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:12.540
Thank you.

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:15.920
Love You...

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.390
"I love you."

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:22.260
Hey! Don't read it out loud!

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:30.860
Do you always read stories
about love, Aya-chan?

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.410
I-I guess.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:34.570
Do you have any ritual books?

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:35.820
"Ritual books"?

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:41.000
You seem like the type to try using magic
circles to summon the person you love.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.290
Summon!

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:44.860
I'd like to do the same with Alice.

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:46.080
Just how do you see me?!

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:49.280
Oh, Shino, you're here too?

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:51.640
I summoned Youko-chan.

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:54.160
Don't come in through the window!
That's unlawful entry!

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:56.460
Well, I heard your voices, so...

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:59.470
You're just like Romeo, Youko-chan.

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:01.590
From Romeo and Juliet.

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:03.140
Does that happen in the story?

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:04.620
Doesn't it?

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:09.680
Youko... Wherefore art thou Youko?

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:10.960
I can't help it...

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:14.560
Now that Alice and Karen are gone,

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:17.070
I realize how important they are to me.

00:16:17.070 --> 00:16:18.740
<i>After just half a day?</i>

00:16:19.050 --> 00:16:22.110
Without them, I can't even breathe.

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:27.600
Yes... They're my oxygen.

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:30.620
At this rate, I'll...

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:32.700
Shino! Hang in there!

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:35.150
Youko! Get the blonde tank for Shino!

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:37.000
What <i>is</i> that?! Sounds like it'd suffocate her!

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:39.530
If you keep acting like that,

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:41.880
Alice will be too worried to enjoy herself.

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:44.140
Y-You're right. I'm sorry.

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:46.510
I will be stronger. Much stronger!

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:50.770
So that when they return from England,
I can welcome them home with a smile!

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:54.900
Why are you working out?

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:58.160
I will strengthen my mind and my muscles!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:00.040
Shino, you're amazing!

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.900
You're heading in the wrong direction!

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:03.510
Good grief...

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:07.070
Hey, can we sleep over
at your place tonight?

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:08.510
Me and Aya, I mean.

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:10.040
Huh? Uh, yeah...

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:12.090
O-Of course.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:14.920
Otherwise, I'd be too lonely to sleep tonight.

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:23.280
Shinobu, Alice-chan just called to say

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:25.910
she'd arrived safely in England.

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:27.180
What?

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:32.030
You can talk all you want
when she comes back.

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:37.060
Shino, I forgot my pajamas.

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.820
I'll lend you some of mine.

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:44.300
Just a T-shirt is fine.

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:46.870
No, I have just the thing.

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:47.670
What?

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.730
Youko-chan, you look so cute!

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:54.010
These pajamas are really hot.

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:56.320
<i>It's amazing how terrible they look on her.</i>

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:00.310
This one.

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:06.780
I'm sorry. I'm getting sleepy.

00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:07.600
It's so early!

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:10.010
I thought you said you couldn't sleep.

00:18:10.010 --> 00:18:13.020
But I'm glad you're feeling better.

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:15.110
All thanks to you two.

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:17.270
We'll come hang out anytime.

00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:19.490
Anyway, um...

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:20.900
What's wrong?

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:26.160
Can I sleep next to you two?

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:31.910
I-Is it me, or are you two
treating me like a child today?

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.660
This brings back memories.

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:38.420
It's like we're back in middle school.

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:40.220
You're right.

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:45.950
This reminds me of my homestay in England.

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.870
I-I'm sorry!

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:06.310
<i>Is it sunny in England?</i>

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:09.110
<i>Do you have jet lag?</i>

00:19:09.530 --> 00:19:10.380
<i>Alice...</i>

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:12.640
<i>I have so much to talk to you about</i>

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:15.260
<i>after just a day without seeing you.</i>

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:54.850
Karen!

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:04.470
I have so much power.

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:06.940
I might even end up going overboard...

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:10.140
Did you think we were lying as usual?

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:12.990
We turned Shinobu-oneechan into a kokeshi doll.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:14.490
<i>So mean...</i>

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:16.130
Kouta! Mitsuki!

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:19.870
Stop this! It won't change anything!

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:22.620
Karen, turn Shino back to normal!

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:24.000
If that's what you want...

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:27.750
Then you'll have to defeat me!

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:41.910
What is that?

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:43.560
It's huge.

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:47.010
I never imagined she'd
actually complete it...

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:51.570
Prepare yourself, Alice.

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:54.830
If it's come to this...

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:58.060
Aya, we have to use the forbidden technique.

00:21:58.060 --> 00:22:01.030
F-Forbidden? W-We mustn't!

00:22:01.030 --> 00:22:01.950
We have to.

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:05.330
Fine.

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:07.450
Release the seal!

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:09.250
Golden Hair!

00:22:34.260 --> 00:22:35.870
They're releasing...

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:36.740
...the seal?

00:22:36.740 --> 00:22:39.240
This radiant golden glow...

00:22:39.680 --> 00:22:42.080
It can't be... Are they also...

00:22:49.850 --> 00:22:52.210
<i>Does this mean... Me, too?!</i>

00:22:58.700 --> 00:22:59.980
What's wrong?

00:23:00.280 --> 00:23:03.480
I just had a really interesting dream.

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:04.820
A dream?

00:23:04.820 --> 00:23:06.360
What kind of dream?

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:09.670
I woke up in the middle of it.

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:12.080
You two were just about to use

00:23:12.080 --> 00:23:14.570
the forbidden technique.

00:23:14.790 --> 00:23:16.070
F-Forbidden?

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:18.130
What's that? I wanna see it!

00:23:18.130 --> 00:23:20.620
Why is it forbidden? Why?

00:23:21.760 --> 00:23:23.610
If I become a kokeshi doll,

00:23:23.610 --> 00:23:26.230
please ship me to England.

00:23:26.230 --> 00:23:30.070
I just know their love will
turn me back to normal.

00:23:26.480 --> 00:23:29.070
Shino! Shino!

00:23:30.070 --> 00:23:31.730
What are you talking about, Shino?!

00:23:31.730 --> 00:23:34.130
Hurry up and come back, Alice!

00:23:33.750 --> 00:23:36.130
Because I Love You More Than Anything

00:23:34.130 --> 00:23:36.130
See you next time.
